1
00:01:35,860 --> 00:01:39,729
[Abyss]

2
00:01:40,509 --> 00:01:42,979
Has Feiyang joined another team?

3
00:01:40,620 --> 00:01:47,110
[Feiyang]

4
00:01:43,039 --> 00:01:44,180
No.

5
00:01:44,979 --> 00:01:47,420
He's just busy with family matters.

6
00:01:47,920 --> 00:01:48,979
He's stepping away

7
00:01:49,410 --> 00:01:52,200
from the game for good.

8
00:01:51,800 --> 00:01:54,380
[Group Management]
[Mr. Han] [Feiyang] [Wei]

9
00:01:52,789 --> 00:01:55,900
Our Mr. Han is so righteous!

10
00:01:55,900 --> 00:01:57,000
If you're so considerate of others,

11
00:01:57,000 --> 00:01:58,979
why don't you give your clients to others?

12
00:01:58,979 --> 00:02:00,750
Why only give them to Feiyang?

13
00:02:01,010 --> 00:02:02,810
Isn't it because you two are in cahoots?

14
00:02:02,810 --> 00:02:04,210
Do you have a conscience?

15
00:02:04,480 --> 00:02:05,570
If Feiyang hadn't brought you in,

16
00:02:05,570 --> 00:02:06,730
would you be where you are today?

17
00:02:06,730 --> 00:02:08,250
And now you're holding
a grudge against him?

18
00:02:08,250 --> 00:02:10,180
Wei, I didn't pick a fight with you.

19
00:02:21,500 --> 00:02:23,650
Mom, aren't you on duty?

20
00:02:23,710 --> 00:02:25,310
Why are you back at this hour?

21
00:02:25,560 --> 00:02:27,560
My stomach hurts, so I took time off.

22
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:30,820
Have a seat first.

23
00:02:30,820 --> 00:02:32,690
Go pour me a glass of hot water.

24
00:02:33,090 --> 00:02:33,780
Okay.

25
00:02:44,460 --> 00:02:45,210
Here, Mom.

26
00:02:51,270 --> 00:02:51,960
Oh my.

27
00:02:53,340 --> 00:02:55,120
I feel much better after
drinking some hot water.

28
00:02:55,120 --> 00:02:56,680
Why did your stomach suddenly hurt?

29
00:02:56,680 --> 00:02:57,870
Did you eat something cold?

30
00:02:57,870 --> 00:02:59,079
I was spooked!

31
00:03:00,030 --> 00:03:02,690
Two police officers suddenly
came to the hotel.

32
00:03:02,910 --> 00:03:05,960
They called everyone to
the duty room for questioning.

33
00:03:05,960 --> 00:03:07,370
I said my son is a police officer

34
00:03:07,370 --> 00:03:08,810
and we are on the same side.

35
00:03:08,810 --> 00:03:10,280
But they ignored me.

36
00:03:10,840 --> 00:03:12,080
What did the police ask?

37
00:03:12,080 --> 00:03:13,530
I was just about to tell you.

38
00:03:13,530 --> 00:03:15,930
That Song we mentioned the other day,

39
00:03:16,050 --> 00:03:17,530
the guy from my workplace?

40
00:03:18,710 --> 00:03:20,030
He died!

41
00:03:22,030 --> 00:03:22,900
What?

42
00:03:23,400 --> 00:03:24,690
Song Laifu is dead?

43
00:03:24,690 --> 00:03:25,860
Exactly.

44
00:03:26,690 --> 00:03:29,210
I even greeted him this morning.

45
00:03:29,780 --> 00:03:30,960
When I heard about this,

46
00:03:30,960 --> 00:03:32,960
I thought of your dad back then.

47
00:03:33,530 --> 00:03:34,990
He was fine in the morning.

48
00:03:35,030 --> 00:03:36,300
We compared his hair

49
00:03:36,600 --> 00:03:38,180
with the skin flakes found under

50
00:03:38,180 --> 00:03:39,180
Liu Xiaohua's fingernails.

51
00:03:39,180 --> 00:03:40,090
The results

52
00:03:40,540 --> 00:03:41,350
didn't match.

53
00:03:46,630 --> 00:03:51,260
[Episode 4]

54
00:03:51,690 --> 00:03:53,860
The deceased, Song Laifu, 54 years old,

55
00:03:52,160 --> 00:03:56,850
[Deceased: Song Laifu] [Age: 54]

56
00:03:54,020 --> 00:03:55,870
A resident of Gaobeizhai Village,
Longhua County,

57
00:03:55,870 --> 00:03:56,910
in the neighboring city of De'ermu.

58
00:03:56,910 --> 00:03:59,860
He worked as a security guard at
Huangzhiyuan Hotel's carpark.

59
00:03:59,860 --> 00:04:01,210
Unmarried, no children.

60
00:04:01,210 --> 00:04:03,030
He lived in the hotel's staff dormitory.

61
00:04:03,030 --> 00:04:03,750
It was 3 migrant workers

62
00:04:03,750 --> 00:04:05,400
from a nearby construction site
who filed the report.

63
00:04:05,400 --> 00:04:07,240
Based on the time of death,

64
00:04:07,240 --> 00:04:08,080
they are not likely suspects of the crime.

65
00:04:08,080 --> 00:04:08,810
We immediately

66
00:04:08,810 --> 00:04:10,030
went to Huangzhiyuan Hotel

67
00:04:10,030 --> 00:04:11,090
and retrieved the surveillance footage.

68
00:04:11,090 --> 00:04:12,860
We found that at 10:07,

69
00:04:12,860 --> 00:04:14,360
Song Laifu received a call.

70
00:04:14,360 --> 00:04:15,930
He looked very unhappy,

71
00:04:16,050 --> 00:04:18,040
stepped on and broke the mop handle,
and then left.

72
00:04:16,690 --> 00:04:19,600
[Camera 01]

73
00:04:19,920 --> 00:04:21,800
We checked Song Laifu's call records.

74
00:04:21,800 --> 00:04:23,950
Two numbers called him once each,

75
00:04:23,950 --> 00:04:26,370
at 1:03 a.m.

76
00:04:26,370 --> 00:04:28,980
and 10:07 a.m.,
as captured by the surveillance.

77
00:04:28,980 --> 00:04:30,650
Between the two calls,

78
00:04:30,130 --> 00:04:31,230
[Time of Unknown Call]

79
00:04:30,690 --> 00:04:32,450
Song Laifu was on duty at the hotel.

80
00:04:32,450 --> 00:04:33,659
One call was from an unregistered number,

81
00:04:33,659 --> 00:04:34,950
and the other

82
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:37,370
was from a public phone booth
near People's Square.

83
00:04:35,110 --> 00:04:35,860
[People's Square]

84
00:04:37,690 --> 00:04:39,120
There is a large flow of people here,

85
00:04:38,530 --> 00:04:40,100
[Phone booth near People's Square]

86
00:04:39,120 --> 00:04:41,190
and the phone booth
is not within the surveillance range.

87
00:04:41,190 --> 00:04:42,620
We can only slowly investigate

88
00:04:42,620 --> 00:04:44,480
to see if there are any witnesses.

89
00:04:44,620 --> 00:04:45,540
Chief Tu.

90
00:04:45,570 --> 00:04:48,040
If the call was made by the suspect,

91
00:04:48,060 --> 00:04:49,430
it means he was well-prepared

92
00:04:49,430 --> 00:04:51,120
and it wasn't a spur-of-the-moment act.

93
00:04:51,120 --> 00:04:53,100
Did Song Laifu have any enemies?

94
00:04:53,100 --> 00:04:54,370
The hotel staff all said

95
00:04:54,370 --> 00:04:56,060
that Song Laifu was quite introverted

96
00:04:56,060 --> 00:04:58,159
and didn't interact much with others.

97
00:04:58,159 --> 00:05:01,330
The only person he had a conflict with was Xin Jiran.

98
00:05:02,430 --> 00:05:03,770
Xin Jiran.

99
00:05:05,060 --> 00:05:06,980
According to the hotel's duty staff,

100
00:05:06,980 --> 00:05:08,370
Xin Jiran, Song Laifu,

101
00:05:08,370 --> 00:05:10,560
and a female hotel employee named Chen Chunli

102
00:05:10,560 --> 00:05:12,360
were involved in a romantic dispute.

103
00:05:12,360 --> 00:05:15,620
He even got into a confrontation with
Song Laifu over this.

104
00:05:15,720 --> 00:05:16,680
Xin?

105
00:05:18,690 --> 00:05:20,950
He's only been out for a few years, right?

106
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:24,220
In the past, he and Ganzhe
caused the most trouble.

107
00:05:26,680 --> 00:05:28,540
Is it that hard for you to
watch your diet?

108
00:05:28,540 --> 00:05:31,010
Do you really have to be
in agonizing pain to feel good?

109
00:05:31,010 --> 00:05:32,690
Gout won't kill you.

110
00:05:32,690 --> 00:05:34,830
If I can't eat or drink all day,

111
00:05:34,830 --> 00:05:36,620
life is meaningless.

112
00:05:36,630 --> 00:05:37,420
Okay, okay.

113
00:05:37,430 --> 00:05:39,120
Your sister-in-law happens to
be in Beijing.

114
00:05:39,120 --> 00:05:41,780
I'll ask her to bring you
some special medicine.

115
00:05:41,920 --> 00:05:42,770
Anyway,

116
00:05:42,770 --> 00:05:44,040
regarding Xin,

117
00:05:44,130 --> 00:05:45,070
I don't believe

118
00:05:45,430 --> 00:05:47,770
he would kill someone over a woman.

119
00:05:47,920 --> 00:05:48,720
Yes, Chief Tu.

120
00:05:48,950 --> 00:05:50,100
The name Chen Chunli

121
00:05:50,100 --> 00:05:52,070
shouldn't be unfamiliar to everyone.

122
00:05:52,070 --> 00:05:54,720
She was the last victim of the 3/12 Case.

123
00:05:54,830 --> 00:05:57,450
It has to be 7 or 8 years since
the 3/12 Case, right?

124
00:05:57,450 --> 00:05:59,740
To be exact, it's been 8 years
and 7 months.

125
00:05:59,740 --> 00:06:01,390
Over the past 8 years,

126
00:06:01,480 --> 00:06:03,180
I've been using my spare time

127
00:06:03,600 --> 00:06:05,070
to repeatedly scrutinize the case

128
00:06:05,070 --> 00:06:06,670
and look for a breakthrough.

129
00:06:07,100 --> 00:06:08,420
No matter how long it's been,

130
00:06:08,420 --> 00:06:10,630
we can't let the suspect

131
00:06:10,680 --> 00:06:11,740
get away with it.

132
00:06:12,480 --> 00:06:13,690
Did you all hear that?

133
00:06:13,980 --> 00:06:15,780
Learn more from Comrade Fanjie.

134
00:06:16,680 --> 00:06:17,360
You,

135
00:06:17,980 --> 00:06:18,910
especially you,

136
00:06:18,980 --> 00:06:20,580
stop fooling around all day.

137
00:06:22,660 --> 00:06:23,620
Any objections?

138
00:06:25,430 --> 00:06:26,800
No, no, no.

139
00:06:29,320 --> 00:06:30,370
At Song Laifu's place,

140
00:06:30,370 --> 00:06:31,540
did you find anything?

141
00:06:31,540 --> 00:06:32,920
[Recipient: Song Laifu]

142
00:06:31,720 --> 00:06:33,240
Song Laifu received a

143
00:06:33,240 --> 00:06:34,690
local package

144
00:06:34,690 --> 00:06:36,620
sent 3 days ago,

145
00:06:36,620 --> 00:06:38,540
but we don't know what's inside.

146
00:06:39,240 --> 00:06:42,159
Judging by the shape, it looks like
a book or a magazine.

147
00:06:42,159 --> 00:06:43,300
His roommate Wu Jianxiong said

148
00:06:43,300 --> 00:06:44,620
he doesn't usually shop online

149
00:06:44,620 --> 00:06:46,300
and barely knows how to use a computer.

150
00:06:46,300 --> 00:06:47,930
The sender is Xiaofei,

151
00:06:47,710 --> 00:06:49,780
[Recipient: Song Laifu]

152
00:06:48,000 --> 00:06:49,330
with no return address.

153
00:06:49,420 --> 00:06:51,330
The sender's address is
this courier station.

154
00:06:51,330 --> 00:06:53,860
The sender must have
dropped it off in person.

155
00:06:54,770 --> 00:06:56,080
This looks like my handwriting.

156
00:06:55,490 --> 00:06:56,909
[Recipient: Song Laifu]

157
00:06:57,140 --> 00:06:58,010
I remember now.

158
00:06:58,690 --> 00:07:00,430
That day, this person came with a dog

159
00:07:00,430 --> 00:07:01,480
and startled me.

160
00:07:01,480 --> 00:07:02,180
Male or female?

161
00:07:02,180 --> 00:07:02,770
What did they look like?

162
00:07:02,770 --> 00:07:03,500
How old?

163
00:07:03,500 --> 00:07:04,240
Male.

164
00:07:05,500 --> 00:07:06,660
A bit taller than me.

165
00:07:06,680 --> 00:07:07,680
He looked quite young,

166
00:07:07,680 --> 00:07:08,500
probably around my age.

167
00:07:08,500 --> 00:07:10,600
He went out of his way to
a courier station

168
00:07:10,600 --> 00:07:12,010
to send a local package,

169
00:07:12,010 --> 00:07:13,950
and then left a fake phone number.

170
00:07:12,040 --> 00:07:13,060
[Name: Song Laifu]

171
00:07:13,950 --> 00:07:15,350
This is very suspicious.

172
00:07:15,780 --> 00:07:17,360
Keep a close eye on this clue.

173
00:07:17,360 --> 00:07:18,100
Don't let up.

174
00:07:18,100 --> 00:07:18,680
Yes.

175
00:07:20,270 --> 00:07:20,890
Comrades.

176
00:07:20,980 --> 00:07:23,250
First, find the crime scene
as soon as possible.

177
00:07:23,250 --> 00:07:24,660
Get the surveillance footage from
the businesses

178
00:07:24,660 --> 00:07:27,240
near the phone booths on
both sides of Kangfu Road,

179
00:07:27,240 --> 00:07:28,740
and check it carefully.

180
00:07:28,770 --> 00:07:30,750
Second, find Xin Jiran

181
00:07:30,860 --> 00:07:32,240
and figure out where he was

182
00:07:32,240 --> 00:07:33,540
during the time of the crime.

183
00:07:33,540 --> 00:07:34,010
Third,

184
00:07:34,010 --> 00:07:35,330
question all the employees

185
00:07:35,330 --> 00:07:36,620
who had contact with Song Laifu,

186
00:07:36,620 --> 00:07:38,100
especially Chen Chunli,

187
00:07:38,560 --> 00:07:40,250
and see if we can find anything new.

188
00:07:40,250 --> 00:07:41,750
Okay, I'll arrange it.

189
00:07:52,540 --> 00:07:53,860
Tipping someone off?

190
00:07:54,240 --> 00:07:56,100
Caught you red-handed, didn't I?

191
00:07:56,130 --> 00:07:57,370
I'm not going home tonight,

192
00:07:57,370 --> 00:07:58,920
so I'm calling my wife.

193
00:07:59,060 --> 00:08:00,740
You think everyone is

194
00:08:00,740 --> 00:08:02,310
as heartless as you are?

195
00:08:02,690 --> 00:08:03,880
You're pretty impressive.

196
00:08:03,880 --> 00:08:05,390
At your age,

197
00:08:05,450 --> 00:08:07,240
you are still reporting to
your wife every day that

198
00:08:07,240 --> 00:08:08,980
that you aren't out cheating.

199
00:08:08,980 --> 00:08:10,390
How impressive!

200
00:08:10,570 --> 00:08:12,310
Why does everything you say

201
00:08:12,310 --> 00:08:13,740
sound so awful?

202
00:08:16,750 --> 00:08:17,880
Help me change this.

203
00:08:21,180 --> 00:08:22,190
Gently. Gently!

204
00:08:22,190 --> 00:08:23,160
Bear with it.

205
00:08:23,160 --> 00:08:23,890
Please peel.

206
00:08:26,240 --> 00:08:27,810
How ruthless!

207
00:08:27,830 --> 00:08:29,180
Your injury hasn't healed yet?

208
00:08:29,180 --> 00:08:30,120
It was healed,

209
00:08:30,120 --> 00:08:32,049
but you are injuring me once again.

210
00:08:33,120 --> 00:08:35,049
Why apply a plaster if it's healed?

211
00:08:35,440 --> 00:08:37,770
You have what the internet calls

212
00:08:38,960 --> 00:08:40,870
a contrarian personality.

213
00:08:40,870 --> 00:08:42,220
What can I do?

214
00:08:42,250 --> 00:08:43,580
In our line of work,

215
00:08:43,580 --> 00:08:45,380
we have to question everything.

216
00:08:50,030 --> 00:08:51,890
If you see Xin Jiran,

217
00:08:51,940 --> 00:08:53,250
tell him

218
00:08:53,390 --> 00:08:56,290
to come to the station early
to explain things clearly.

219
00:08:56,290 --> 00:08:58,910
He shouldn't let what
nobody wants to see happen,

220
00:08:58,910 --> 00:09:00,500
and even get you involved.

221
00:09:07,910 --> 00:09:09,340
You care about me.

222
00:09:11,270 --> 00:09:13,130
I don't care about you at all.

223
00:09:13,670 --> 00:09:15,470
I care about our police station.

224
00:09:16,100 --> 00:09:17,250
For so many years,

225
00:09:17,250 --> 00:09:19,750
we haven't recruited
a single good prospect.

226
00:09:19,750 --> 00:09:21,390
Us old guys

227
00:09:21,440 --> 00:09:23,120
have no choice but to hold on

228
00:09:23,120 --> 00:09:24,820
if we can.

229
00:09:26,900 --> 00:09:28,320
[Save water]

230
00:09:53,390 --> 00:09:54,450
What are you doing?

231
00:09:55,150 --> 00:09:56,790
What are you doing sneaking around?

232
00:09:56,790 --> 00:09:57,770
You scared me.

233
00:09:57,770 --> 00:09:58,670
Police!

234
00:09:58,670 --> 00:09:59,870
What the hell? Don't move!

235
00:09:59,870 --> 00:10:01,000
Keep your distance!

236
00:10:05,510 --> 00:10:06,700
O-Officer.

237
00:10:06,890 --> 00:10:08,820
Do you know the person in this room?

238
00:10:08,890 --> 00:10:10,270
Yes, Officer!

239
00:10:11,150 --> 00:10:12,120
Xin Jiran.

240
00:10:12,410 --> 00:10:13,700
Male, 51 years old, sells dates.

241
00:10:13,700 --> 00:10:14,770
He leaves at about 7:00 a.m.,

242
00:10:14,770 --> 00:10:15,940
and comes back after 8:00 p.m.

243
00:10:15,940 --> 00:10:17,130
He definitely didn't come back today.

244
00:10:17,130 --> 00:10:17,600
Why?

245
00:10:17,600 --> 00:10:18,700
Because the soundproofing here is bad,

246
00:10:18,700 --> 00:10:19,200
and my hearing is good.

247
00:10:19,200 --> 00:10:20,460
I can hear everything.

248
00:10:21,150 --> 00:10:22,410
I haven't even asked you anything yet,

249
00:10:22,410 --> 00:10:23,740
yet you're answering so clearly.

250
00:10:23,740 --> 00:10:25,340
We were cellmates in prison.

251
00:10:25,390 --> 00:10:26,370
I even found him

252
00:10:26,370 --> 00:10:27,510
this apartment he is living in.

253
00:10:27,510 --> 00:10:29,290
But what he does in there every day,

254
00:10:29,290 --> 00:10:30,120
I have no idea.

255
00:10:30,150 --> 00:10:31,340
If he's doing anything illegal,

256
00:10:31,340 --> 00:10:32,720
please investigate it thoroughly.

257
00:10:32,720 --> 00:10:34,920
It definitely has nothing to do with me.

258
00:10:36,050 --> 00:10:37,480
Do you need me to open the door for you?

259
00:10:37,480 --> 00:10:38,480
You have the key?

260
00:10:43,650 --> 00:10:45,740
No need for a key. This door is broken.

261
00:10:48,770 --> 00:10:49,950
Please come in.

262
00:10:50,410 --> 00:10:51,390
What a fuss!

263
00:10:55,720 --> 00:10:57,830
[Camera 01]

264
00:11:01,720 --> 00:11:03,790
[Calling: Elite Student]

265
00:11:09,630 --> 00:11:11,720
Who is calling in the middle of the night

266
00:11:11,720 --> 00:11:13,180
and you're not answering?

267
00:11:14,150 --> 00:11:15,010
Xin Jiran?

268
00:11:16,320 --> 00:11:17,450
Bet a hundred bucks?

269
00:11:19,340 --> 00:11:21,130
Why are you such a bore?

270
00:11:26,720 --> 00:11:27,500
Hello.

271
00:11:27,840 --> 00:11:29,010
Song Laifu is dead?

272
00:11:31,320 --> 00:11:32,000
How did he die?

273
00:11:32,000 --> 00:11:33,500
Is it related to what we're investigating?

274
00:11:33,500 --> 00:11:35,390
Didn't I tell you?

275
00:11:35,500 --> 00:11:37,720
I have an urgent case tonight
and have to work overtime.

276
00:11:37,720 --> 00:11:40,520
My colleagues are all here.
I can't just slip away.

277
00:11:40,700 --> 00:11:41,530
Understood.

278
00:11:41,620 --> 00:11:43,480
Contact me when it's convenient.

279
00:11:51,940 --> 00:11:54,790
Wang Tao said he can't find
Xin Jiran anywhere.

280
00:11:55,480 --> 00:11:57,740
Could he have fled to escape punishment?

281
00:11:59,290 --> 00:12:01,860
You haven't made any progress in
investigating cases,

282
00:12:01,860 --> 00:12:04,520
but you're sure eager to
hand down convictions.

283
00:12:07,410 --> 00:12:08,290
Zhao.

284
00:12:08,550 --> 00:12:10,030
I advised you a long time ago

285
00:12:10,030 --> 00:12:11,790
not to always protect Xin,

286
00:12:11,840 --> 00:12:13,500
but you just wouldn't listen.

287
00:12:13,530 --> 00:12:15,580
Now that you've caused such a huge mess,

288
00:12:15,580 --> 00:12:17,480
how are you going to clean it up?

289
00:12:17,550 --> 00:12:18,460
Do you really think

290
00:12:18,460 --> 00:12:20,580
Xin would have a petty feud with
a parking lot attendant

291
00:12:20,580 --> 00:12:21,940
just because of a woman,

292
00:12:21,940 --> 00:12:23,200
and even kill someone?

293
00:12:23,910 --> 00:12:24,980
Don't act like you're all righteous

294
00:12:24,980 --> 00:12:27,180
whenever Xin comes up in conversation.

295
00:12:27,840 --> 00:12:29,170
It's annoying to watch.

296
00:12:29,200 --> 00:12:30,630
If it has nothing to do with him,

297
00:12:30,630 --> 00:12:31,980
why did he run?

298
00:12:32,150 --> 00:12:33,740
I'm asking you, why did he run?

299
00:12:33,740 --> 00:12:36,340
Have you been a cop for so many years
for nothing?

300
00:12:36,340 --> 00:12:38,460
Doesn't wanting to avoid people
necessarily mean he's guilty?

301
00:12:38,460 --> 00:12:39,860
Who wants to be escorted back

302
00:12:39,860 --> 00:12:42,030
by old colleagues with great fanfare?

303
00:12:42,030 --> 00:12:43,000
Even if there's no evidence,

304
00:12:43,000 --> 00:12:44,170
will you let him go?

305
00:12:44,270 --> 00:12:45,050
Is he crazy?

306
00:12:45,050 --> 00:12:47,110
Does he like being locked up in there?

307
00:12:49,980 --> 00:12:51,340
I didn't realize before

308
00:12:51,340 --> 00:12:53,600
how good your relationship with Xin was.

309
00:12:53,670 --> 00:12:55,700
How come you guys are allies now?

310
00:12:56,980 --> 00:12:58,700
[Camera 01]

311
00:12:58,980 --> 00:13:00,460
I just want to solve the case.

312
00:13:00,460 --> 00:13:02,960
Who doesn't want to solve the case?

313
00:13:03,440 --> 00:13:04,050
Look,

314
00:13:04,390 --> 00:13:06,450
you still say you're not helping Xin.

315
00:13:10,720 --> 00:13:12,700
When my Zhao Ying was little,

316
00:13:13,320 --> 00:13:15,120
Xiaoliang took good care of her.

317
00:13:16,790 --> 00:13:18,790
She also liked Xiaoliang very much.

318
00:13:19,130 --> 00:13:20,790
After Xiaoliang died,

319
00:13:22,130 --> 00:13:23,990
Zhao Ying was very disappointed.

320
00:13:24,100 --> 00:13:26,010
Since then, I feel

321
00:13:26,910 --> 00:13:27,840
she no longer worships me

322
00:13:27,840 --> 00:13:30,100
as her police father.

323
00:13:31,870 --> 00:13:33,980
Maybe the child has grown up?

324
00:13:37,120 --> 00:13:37,860
Hello?

325
00:13:38,700 --> 00:13:40,250
It's me, Big Red Date.

326
00:13:40,340 --> 00:13:41,400
Song Laifu is dead.

327
00:13:42,630 --> 00:13:43,550
I heard.

328
00:13:43,910 --> 00:13:45,120
What exactly happened?

329
00:13:45,120 --> 00:13:45,980
Who did it?

330
00:13:46,440 --> 00:13:47,250
I don't know.

331
00:13:47,620 --> 00:13:48,910
But the police are looking for me.

332
00:13:48,910 --> 00:13:50,040
If it's convenient,

333
00:13:50,320 --> 00:13:52,520
let's meet at the usual place
at 9 p.m. tomorrow.

334
00:13:52,520 --> 00:13:54,200
Why are the police looking for you?

335
00:13:54,200 --> 00:13:55,460
Something happened.

336
00:13:55,460 --> 00:13:57,340
It's hard to explain
in a few words right now.

337
00:13:57,340 --> 00:13:58,670
We'll talk when we meet.

338
00:13:59,000 --> 00:14:00,500
Don't tell Zhao Ganzhe

339
00:14:00,500 --> 00:14:01,700
that I contacted you.

340
00:14:01,750 --> 00:14:03,950
It will put him in a difficult position.

341
00:14:11,190 --> 00:14:13,890
[Huangzhiyuan Hotel]

342
00:14:14,870 --> 00:14:17,130
Hurry up! We're just waiting for you two.

343
00:14:19,440 --> 00:14:20,870
Alright, since everyone is here,

344
00:14:20,870 --> 00:14:22,600
I'll get straight to the point.

345
00:14:22,840 --> 00:14:24,700
Song Laifu had an accident outside.

346
00:14:24,700 --> 00:14:26,360
The police will be in
the staff lounge later

347
00:14:26,360 --> 00:14:27,370
to question you one by one.

348
00:14:27,370 --> 00:14:28,430
Our boss has said to

349
00:14:28,480 --> 00:14:29,480
answer whatever they ask.

350
00:14:29,480 --> 00:14:30,480
Tell the truth,

351
00:14:30,480 --> 00:14:31,940
and don't try to outsmart.

352
00:14:32,720 --> 00:14:33,520
What's wrong?

353
00:14:33,790 --> 00:14:34,960
Must I go?

354
00:14:35,510 --> 00:14:37,630
I was already questioned once yesterday.

355
00:14:37,630 --> 00:14:40,700
Besides, I'm not familiar with Song.

356
00:14:41,270 --> 00:14:43,200
Why do you have so many complaints?

357
00:14:43,320 --> 00:14:44,630
Our boss is being questioned
inside right now.

358
00:14:44,630 --> 00:14:45,830
What else do you want?

359
00:14:49,670 --> 00:14:51,120
Song?

360
00:14:51,460 --> 00:14:52,050
Yes.

361
00:14:52,600 --> 00:14:53,530
An old employee.

362
00:14:54,390 --> 00:14:55,510
But I'm not familiar with him.

363
00:14:55,510 --> 00:14:56,580
As you all know,

364
00:14:56,580 --> 00:14:59,080
I have quite a few businesses.

365
00:14:59,340 --> 00:15:01,820
I rarely come to the hotel,

366
00:15:01,820 --> 00:15:04,080
let alone pay attention to
a nighttime watchman.

367
00:15:04,080 --> 00:15:06,870
Mr. Li, you must be really wealthy.

368
00:15:08,390 --> 00:15:09,630
Huangzhiyuan Hotel

369
00:15:09,630 --> 00:15:11,630
is considered the best hotel
in our county,

370
00:15:11,630 --> 00:15:12,290
right?

371
00:15:12,620 --> 00:15:14,050
And yet, to Mr. Li,

372
00:15:14,120 --> 00:15:16,280
it's a business he looks down upon.

373
00:15:17,170 --> 00:15:18,770
You're joking, Captain Fan.

374
00:15:18,840 --> 00:15:20,910
It's not about looking down on it.

375
00:15:20,910 --> 00:15:22,200
No matter how small a fly is,

376
00:15:22,200 --> 00:15:23,320
it's still meat.

377
00:15:23,470 --> 00:15:24,930
It's just that the hotel

378
00:15:25,220 --> 00:15:26,220
is easy to manage.

379
00:15:26,670 --> 00:15:29,300
I have two real estate projects
in Gucheng,

380
00:15:29,370 --> 00:15:32,570
which are much more complicated
than running this hotel.

381
00:15:32,700 --> 00:15:36,560
Our county leaders are paying
close attention to these projects too.

382
00:15:37,340 --> 00:15:38,830
I'm not trying to elevate myself

383
00:15:38,830 --> 00:15:40,830
by saying something like this.

384
00:15:40,860 --> 00:15:42,390
Since I made a special trip here,

385
00:15:42,390 --> 00:15:44,370
I'm trying to show my proactive attitude.

386
00:15:44,370 --> 00:15:46,720
I hope you can catch the murderer soon.

387
00:15:46,750 --> 00:15:47,440
That way, I can also

388
00:15:47,440 --> 00:15:49,390
give an explanation to all the employees.

389
00:15:49,390 --> 00:15:51,790
Who do you think is closer to Song Laifu?

390
00:15:53,380 --> 00:15:54,620
You can ask Manager Zhang.

391
00:15:54,620 --> 00:15:55,700
Song is under his management.

392
00:15:55,700 --> 00:15:56,750
If he can't explain it clearly,

393
00:15:56,750 --> 00:15:57,740
that's a dereliction of duty.

394
00:15:57,740 --> 00:15:59,470
Tell me, and I'll deal with him.

395
00:15:59,480 --> 00:16:02,370
[Staff Lounge]

396
00:15:59,960 --> 00:16:01,090
No need to see me out.

397
00:16:02,830 --> 00:16:03,600
Come in.

398
00:16:03,600 --> 00:16:04,500
Call Chen Chunli next.

399
00:16:04,500 --> 00:16:05,250
Okay.

400
00:16:11,960 --> 00:16:13,360
How did you handle this?

401
00:16:12,110 --> 00:16:18,630
[Staff Lounge]

402
00:16:13,360 --> 00:16:15,530
How did you end up attracting the police?

403
00:16:15,530 --> 00:16:16,670
I don't know either.

404
00:16:16,670 --> 00:16:18,870
What's going on with Song?

405
00:16:18,870 --> 00:16:21,010
Huangshui Jiayuan is about to be
put up for sale.

406
00:16:21,010 --> 00:16:22,720
If it affects that,
who will take the blame?

407
00:16:22,720 --> 00:16:24,010
You or me?

408
00:16:27,390 --> 00:16:28,120
After the police leave,

409
00:16:28,120 --> 00:16:29,510
hold a meeting for all staff.

410
00:16:29,510 --> 00:16:30,860
Emphasize that

411
00:16:30,860 --> 00:16:32,470
Song Laifu died outside.

412
00:16:32,510 --> 00:16:33,340
Am I clear?

413
00:16:33,340 --> 00:16:34,750
Alright.

414
00:16:34,750 --> 00:16:35,870
If anyone dares to talk nonsense

415
00:16:35,870 --> 00:16:37,200
and affect my business,

416
00:16:38,290 --> 00:16:40,340
I'll make their life a living hell.

417
00:16:42,220 --> 00:16:43,120
Then, Mr. Li...

418
00:16:43,120 --> 00:16:44,620
should I fire Chen Chunli or...

419
00:16:44,620 --> 00:16:45,320
I don't care.

420
00:16:45,320 --> 00:16:47,150
Clean up your own mess.

421
00:16:47,440 --> 00:16:48,980
If you cause any more trouble,

422
00:16:48,980 --> 00:16:50,580
dig a hole and bury yourself.

423
00:16:50,750 --> 00:16:51,840
Yes, don't worry, Mr. Li.

424
00:16:51,840 --> 00:16:53,510
This won't happen again.

425
00:16:53,980 --> 00:16:56,410
He and I are just ordinary colleagues.

426
00:16:56,460 --> 00:16:58,270
We don't have much contact.

427
00:16:58,940 --> 00:17:01,860
But I haven't heard of any problems
with him.

428
00:17:01,860 --> 00:17:03,240
Many people say

429
00:17:03,480 --> 00:17:04,550
he pursued you.

430
00:17:04,550 --> 00:17:06,700
I can't control what he thinks,

431
00:17:06,700 --> 00:17:08,810
but I am definitely not interested.

432
00:17:09,109 --> 00:17:12,180
We only have one microwave
in the staff lounge.

433
00:17:12,180 --> 00:17:14,000
Every time we eat,

434
00:17:14,000 --> 00:17:15,380
there are over a dozen people

435
00:17:15,380 --> 00:17:16,900
lining up to heat up their food.

436
00:17:16,900 --> 00:17:18,329
When I get impatient,

437
00:17:18,329 --> 00:17:20,460
I go to his security booth

438
00:17:20,460 --> 00:17:22,720
to borrow his small stove.

439
00:17:22,770 --> 00:17:24,329
Did Song Laifu say anything about

440
00:17:24,329 --> 00:17:25,960
you borrowing the stove?

441
00:17:27,030 --> 00:17:29,160
He's quite amiable.

442
00:17:30,240 --> 00:17:31,290
Amiable?

443
00:17:32,000 --> 00:17:33,370
When he gets angry,

444
00:17:33,400 --> 00:17:34,480
he looks like he wants to kill someone.

445
00:17:34,480 --> 00:17:35,960
Is there any specific incident?

446
00:17:35,960 --> 00:17:37,000
I'll tell you,

447
00:17:37,000 --> 00:17:38,140
but don't tell anyone else.

448
00:17:38,140 --> 00:17:39,510
Otherwise, they'll wrong me

449
00:17:39,510 --> 00:17:41,480
and say I'm gossiping even in his death.

450
00:17:41,480 --> 00:17:42,350
Don't worry.

451
00:17:42,530 --> 00:17:44,590
Everything you say in this room

452
00:17:44,590 --> 00:17:46,120
is strictly confidential.

453
00:17:46,940 --> 00:17:48,160
Xin Jiran has been

454
00:17:48,160 --> 00:17:50,220
causing trouble at the hotel lately.

455
00:17:50,330 --> 00:17:51,530
Do you know why?

456
00:17:52,030 --> 00:17:54,550
I... think I know.

457
00:17:55,850 --> 00:17:58,400
He just wants to investigate that case.

458
00:17:58,810 --> 00:18:01,880
So he keeps coming to me,

459
00:18:02,440 --> 00:18:04,110
asking this and that.

460
00:18:05,480 --> 00:18:07,380
But whatever I know,

461
00:18:07,380 --> 00:18:08,930
I've already told you.

462
00:18:09,090 --> 00:18:10,660
I have nothing more to say.

463
00:18:12,790 --> 00:18:15,510
I didn't dare admit to the hotel

464
00:18:16,250 --> 00:18:17,940
that he was looking for me.

465
00:18:22,090 --> 00:18:25,460
Was there any bad blood between
Song Laifu and Xin Jiran?

466
00:18:26,090 --> 00:18:27,420
I don't know about that.

467
00:18:28,590 --> 00:18:29,880
But I promise there's no

468
00:18:29,880 --> 00:18:31,960
love triangle or anything.

469
00:18:32,200 --> 00:18:34,200
I'm not close to either of them.

470
00:18:35,220 --> 00:18:38,310
If you want to ask about Song Laifu,

471
00:18:38,310 --> 00:18:41,500
I think you can ask Zhang Chengguo.

472
00:18:42,030 --> 00:18:42,960
Your manager?

473
00:18:42,960 --> 00:18:45,830
That day when I passed by the staff lounge,

474
00:18:45,830 --> 00:18:48,510
I heard them chatting inside.

475
00:18:49,010 --> 00:18:52,400
Song Laifu was hired by Zhang Chengguo.

476
00:18:52,440 --> 00:18:56,160
They must have known each other for years.

477
00:19:01,680 --> 00:19:03,250
I hired Song.

478
00:19:03,510 --> 00:19:04,110
Before,

479
00:19:04,110 --> 00:19:05,460
he was working at a friend's

480
00:19:05,460 --> 00:19:06,380
construction site.

481
00:19:06,380 --> 00:19:07,660
When I got off work and had nothing to do,

482
00:19:07,660 --> 00:19:08,750
I would often go to their shed

483
00:19:08,750 --> 00:19:09,810
to play cards with him.

484
00:19:09,810 --> 00:19:11,290
That's how we got to know each other.

485
00:19:11,290 --> 00:19:12,290
Later,

486
00:19:12,290 --> 00:19:15,000
he said the work at the construction site
was too tiring

487
00:19:15,000 --> 00:19:16,980
and asked me to find him an easier job.

488
00:19:16,980 --> 00:19:19,310
My security post happened to
be short of hands.

489
00:19:19,310 --> 00:19:21,220
So I told him to come and give it a try.

490
00:19:21,220 --> 00:19:22,740
It was just a small favor.

491
00:19:22,740 --> 00:19:23,740
So why not, right?

492
00:19:23,980 --> 00:19:25,980
What’s Song Laifu’s work ethic like?

493
00:19:25,980 --> 00:19:27,780
Did he make enemies with anyone?

494
00:19:28,420 --> 00:19:29,200
He was good.

495
00:19:29,420 --> 00:19:31,270
His attitude was really good.

496
00:19:31,350 --> 00:19:32,530
He took work seriously too.

497
00:19:32,530 --> 00:19:34,240
As for making enemies,

498
00:19:34,920 --> 00:19:36,550
I don't think he would.

499
00:19:36,810 --> 00:19:38,640
Song was very honest.

500
00:19:38,640 --> 00:19:40,030
He talked little

501
00:19:40,050 --> 00:19:41,420
and worked steadily.

502
00:19:41,590 --> 00:19:42,720
He wasn't the type

503
00:19:42,720 --> 00:19:45,050
to actively look for trouble with others.

504
00:19:45,200 --> 00:19:47,880
At least that's how it seemed to me.

505
00:19:47,960 --> 00:19:49,590
On the day of Song Laifu's accident,

506
00:19:49,590 --> 00:19:51,390
he kicked and broke a mop handle.

507
00:19:51,400 --> 00:19:53,860
It looked like he was
going to fight someone.

508
00:19:53,920 --> 00:19:55,780
Do you know who he was looking for?

509
00:19:59,040 --> 00:20:00,480
That happened?

510
00:20:02,770 --> 00:20:04,510
Let me guess.

511
00:20:04,510 --> 00:20:06,720
He probably went to find that drunk guy.

512
00:20:06,720 --> 00:20:08,650
What's his name... Xin something?

513
00:20:09,810 --> 00:20:12,070
I heard they had a grudge.

514
00:20:12,480 --> 00:20:13,660
In your opinion,

515
00:20:13,660 --> 00:20:16,330
besides hotel colleagues

516
00:20:16,330 --> 00:20:17,570
and guests,

517
00:20:17,570 --> 00:20:20,500
did Song Laifu had contact with
any other outsiders?

518
00:20:21,480 --> 00:20:23,220
Very rarely.

519
00:20:25,500 --> 00:20:27,830
We have a cleaner named Sun Yuhua
in our hotel.

520
00:20:27,830 --> 00:20:30,330
Her son talked to Song a few days ago.

521
00:20:30,400 --> 00:20:31,050
I just remembered.

522
00:20:31,050 --> 00:20:32,750
I thought it was strange at the time.

523
00:20:32,750 --> 00:20:33,310
I wondered how these two

524
00:20:33,310 --> 00:20:34,810
could even have anything to talk about.

525
00:20:34,350 --> 00:20:35,130
[Employee Record Form] [Sun Yuhua]

526
00:20:35,310 --> 00:20:36,370
The cleaner's son?

527
00:20:36,880 --> 00:20:37,740
What's his name?

528
00:20:37,740 --> 00:20:38,870
His name is Li Cheng.

529
00:20:46,960 --> 00:20:48,180
What is the relationship between
your son Li Cheng

530
00:20:48,180 --> 00:20:49,610
and Song Laifu?

531
00:20:50,850 --> 00:20:52,110
What relationship?

532
00:20:52,110 --> 00:20:53,720
They don't even know each other.

533
00:20:53,720 --> 00:20:54,770
Why would my son ever get involved in

534
00:20:54,770 --> 00:20:56,700
matters of murder and arson?

535
00:20:56,700 --> 00:20:57,770
What's going on?

536
00:20:57,770 --> 00:20:59,640
Don't panic. We're just asking.

537
00:20:59,640 --> 00:21:02,290
Someone saw your son talking to Song Laifu.

538
00:21:02,290 --> 00:21:03,460
So what if they talked?

539
00:21:03,460 --> 00:21:04,880
So what?

540
00:21:04,880 --> 00:21:06,290
We are talking right now.

541
00:21:06,290 --> 00:21:07,880
If you go out and get hit by a car later,

542
00:21:07,880 --> 00:21:08,680
does it have anything to do with me?

543
00:21:08,680 --> 00:21:10,140
-You...
-What are you talking about?

544
00:21:10,140 --> 00:21:10,740
Sit down.

545
00:21:12,900 --> 00:21:14,770
I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

546
00:21:15,550 --> 00:21:16,270
I'm sorry.

547
00:21:16,270 --> 00:21:18,200
Officer, I didn't mean to curse you.

548
00:21:18,200 --> 00:21:20,160
I'm just so angry.

549
00:21:20,240 --> 00:21:21,690
This is ridiculous.

550
00:21:21,740 --> 00:21:22,720
No need to explain.

551
00:21:22,720 --> 00:21:24,110
Answering questions properly

552
00:21:24,110 --> 00:21:25,900
is the best way to help your son.

553
00:21:29,500 --> 00:21:30,680
Officers,

554
00:21:31,590 --> 00:21:34,590
whoever mentioned my son to you

555
00:21:34,790 --> 00:21:36,660
must have bad intentions.

556
00:21:37,240 --> 00:21:39,920
Don't let such people mislead you.

557
00:21:41,790 --> 00:21:43,770
Let me analyze this for you.

558
00:21:43,770 --> 00:21:45,370
At the beginning of the year,

559
00:21:45,610 --> 00:21:47,290
Song Laifu and Chen Chunli,

560
00:21:47,330 --> 00:21:48,940
they had a pretty good relationship.

561
00:21:48,940 --> 00:21:50,790
About three months ago,

562
00:21:51,550 --> 00:21:54,380
Xin Jiran came out of nowhere.

563
00:21:54,500 --> 00:21:56,920
The one who's drunk every day.

564
00:21:56,980 --> 00:21:58,440
Chen Chunli had a change of heart.

565
00:21:58,440 --> 00:21:59,980
She stopped talking to Song Laifu.

566
00:21:59,980 --> 00:22:02,070
Song Laifu must have been angry.

567
00:22:02,140 --> 00:22:03,550
He must have been frustrated.

568
00:22:03,550 --> 00:22:04,980
He kept asking around

569
00:22:04,980 --> 00:22:07,100
where Xin Jiran lived.

570
00:22:07,140 --> 00:22:08,240
Until yesterday,

571
00:22:08,330 --> 00:22:09,980
he finally found out.

572
00:22:09,980 --> 00:22:12,500
He grabbed a weapon and
went to settle the score with Xin Jiran.

573
00:22:12,500 --> 00:22:15,250
Unexpectedly, this drunkard Xin Jiran

574
00:22:15,250 --> 00:22:18,380
was very agile when he wasn't drinking.

575
00:22:18,380 --> 00:22:20,770
As a result, Song was killed instead.

576
00:22:22,090 --> 00:22:23,890
That's probably what happened.

577
00:22:24,980 --> 00:22:26,380
That's right. Let me tell you,

578
00:22:26,380 --> 00:22:27,920
that must be it.

579
00:22:31,510 --> 00:22:32,460
Case closed.

580
00:22:38,290 --> 00:22:41,840
[Welcome home]

581
00:22:38,570 --> 00:22:39,310
Mom.

582
00:22:39,830 --> 00:22:41,030
You're finally here.

583
00:22:41,550 --> 00:22:43,220
Why did the police call me here?

584
00:22:43,220 --> 00:22:44,260
It doesn't matter.

585
00:22:44,260 --> 00:22:45,320
At first,

586
00:22:45,350 --> 00:22:46,200
I was very unhappy

587
00:22:46,200 --> 00:22:48,070
that they dragged you into this.

588
00:22:48,090 --> 00:22:49,050
Then I thought about it.

589
00:22:49,050 --> 00:22:50,660
Wait, isn't this an opportunity?

590
00:22:50,660 --> 00:22:51,900
You have to seize it.

591
00:22:51,900 --> 00:22:52,850
No, no, Mom.

592
00:22:52,920 --> 00:22:54,250
What opportunity?

593
00:22:54,250 --> 00:22:55,380
I don't understand.

594
00:22:55,770 --> 00:22:57,980
The two police officers you'll see later

595
00:22:57,980 --> 00:23:00,090
are both leaders of the county's
public security bureau.

596
00:23:00,090 --> 00:23:01,680
Just win over either of them,

597
00:23:01,680 --> 00:23:02,400
got it?

598
00:23:02,680 --> 00:23:03,480
They called me here

599
00:23:03,480 --> 00:23:05,410
just to ask some questions, right?

600
00:23:05,550 --> 00:23:07,050
Trying to suck up to them
would be inappropriate, no?

601
00:23:07,050 --> 00:23:09,770
Is sucking up all that I
have ever taught you?

602
00:23:10,900 --> 00:23:12,900
I have already paved the way for you.

603
00:23:12,920 --> 00:23:15,220
Song's case is not complicated.

604
00:23:15,220 --> 00:23:15,960
With just a few words,

605
00:23:15,960 --> 00:23:17,750
I sorted it all out clearly.

606
00:23:17,790 --> 00:23:19,090
They might not say anything,

607
00:23:19,090 --> 00:23:21,690
but they definitely admire me
in their hearts.

608
00:23:22,640 --> 00:23:24,680
Mom, you're amazing.

609
00:23:25,030 --> 00:23:26,030
I am amazing.

610
00:23:26,030 --> 00:23:26,720
Let's go.

611
00:23:26,770 --> 00:23:27,550
Let me tell you.

612
00:23:27,550 --> 00:23:29,210
Don't laugh! Be serious!

613
00:23:32,900 --> 00:23:33,810
Come in.

614
00:23:44,660 --> 00:23:46,790
You know why we called you here, right?

615
00:23:47,940 --> 00:23:50,160
My mom said the hotel security guard,
Song Laifu,

616
00:23:50,160 --> 00:23:50,900
had an accident.

617
00:23:50,900 --> 00:23:53,590
I just had a conversation with Song Laifu
a few days ago.

618
00:23:53,590 --> 00:23:55,050
You want to know

619
00:23:55,050 --> 00:23:56,980
what I talked to him about that day.

620
00:23:57,330 --> 00:24:01,130
You intentionally struck up a conversation
with Song Laifu, right?

621
00:24:02,240 --> 00:24:02,960
Yes.

622
00:24:03,030 --> 00:24:04,030
A while ago,

623
00:24:04,110 --> 00:24:06,090
I saw a man named Xin Jiran

624
00:24:06,090 --> 00:24:08,250
causing a disturbance
while drunk in the hotel lobby.

625
00:24:08,250 --> 00:24:09,980
The manager called the police
and had him taken away.

626
00:24:09,980 --> 00:24:12,200
Later, I heard he often comes
to make trouble,

627
00:24:12,200 --> 00:24:13,680
and the police can't do anything about him.

628
00:24:13,680 --> 00:24:16,590
I think this issue needs to be solved
from the root.

629
00:24:17,050 --> 00:24:18,240
After asking around,

630
00:24:18,240 --> 00:24:19,720
I learned that Song Laifu and Xin Jiran

631
00:24:19,720 --> 00:24:20,790
have some conflicts.

632
00:24:20,790 --> 00:24:22,400
So I took the initiative to
approach Song Laifu,

633
00:24:22,400 --> 00:24:23,790
wanting to understand the situation

634
00:24:23,790 --> 00:24:25,110
and see if there's any way

635
00:24:25,110 --> 00:24:27,240
to resolve the conflict between them.

636
00:24:30,440 --> 00:24:32,300
What does this have to do with you?

637
00:24:32,350 --> 00:24:33,550
Although it will be two months

638
00:24:33,550 --> 00:24:34,660
before I officially start working

639
00:24:34,660 --> 00:24:36,030
as a police officer,

640
00:24:36,030 --> 00:24:38,090
I have this sense of responsibility.

641
00:24:38,500 --> 00:24:40,900
Besides, my mom works at this hotel.

642
00:24:40,940 --> 00:24:41,900
Someone causing trouble

643
00:24:41,900 --> 00:24:43,790
is a safety hazard for her.

644
00:24:44,440 --> 00:24:45,160
Not bad.

645
00:24:45,440 --> 00:24:47,070
Then did you figure out the conflict

646
00:24:47,070 --> 00:24:49,640
between Song Laifu and this Xin Jiran?

647
00:24:49,640 --> 00:24:50,890
Not yet.

648
00:24:51,400 --> 00:24:52,500
But I think

649
00:24:52,720 --> 00:24:54,200
it's definitely not just
a relationship dispute.

650
00:24:54,200 --> 00:24:54,920
Reason?

651
00:24:55,030 --> 00:24:56,090
Xin Jiran has absolutely no

652
00:24:56,090 --> 00:24:58,200
intention of pursuing Chen Chunli.

653
00:24:58,240 --> 00:24:59,400
His drunken disturbances

654
00:24:59,400 --> 00:25:01,090
only caused trouble for Chen Chunli

655
00:25:01,090 --> 00:25:02,270
and increase her stress.

656
00:25:02,270 --> 00:25:03,000
Of course,

657
00:25:03,010 --> 00:25:04,440
it's also possible that his

658
00:25:04,440 --> 00:25:06,570
personal understanding of love
is somewhat skewed.

659
00:25:06,570 --> 00:25:08,410
But I asked around carefully.

660
00:25:08,590 --> 00:25:10,900
Xin Jiran used to be a police officer,

661
00:25:10,900 --> 00:25:13,340
and his family was ruined
because of a case.

662
00:25:13,900 --> 00:25:16,590
This case has not been fully solved
to this day.

663
00:25:16,750 --> 00:25:18,070
So I think

664
00:25:18,140 --> 00:25:20,140
Xin Jiran's motive to investigate the case

665
00:25:20,140 --> 00:25:22,390
is far greater than pursuing a cleaner.

666
00:25:22,440 --> 00:25:23,440
How did you know that

667
00:25:23,440 --> 00:25:25,590
Xin Jiran used to be a police officer?

668
00:25:27,420 --> 00:25:29,680
Xin Jiran's neighbors know some things.

669
00:25:29,750 --> 00:25:30,880
I spent a little money

670
00:25:30,880 --> 00:25:32,010
to find out all this.

671
00:25:32,110 --> 00:25:33,240
Not bad.

672
00:25:34,180 --> 00:25:34,740
Okay.

673
00:25:35,030 --> 00:25:35,590
Very good.

674
00:25:35,590 --> 00:25:37,120
Zhao, no questions, right?

675
00:25:37,550 --> 00:25:38,140
No.

676
00:25:38,140 --> 00:25:39,030
Not at all.

677
00:25:39,640 --> 00:25:40,960
Thank you for your cooperation.

678
00:25:40,960 --> 00:25:42,180
We'll stop here for today.

679
00:25:42,180 --> 00:25:44,500
I also hope to see the day

680
00:25:44,590 --> 00:25:46,650
you officially join the police force soon.

681
00:25:46,650 --> 00:25:47,640
Thank you, Sir.

682
00:25:47,640 --> 00:25:48,220
Okay.

683
00:25:48,500 --> 00:25:49,900
I'll be going then.

684
00:25:49,900 --> 00:25:51,290
Okay, let's go.

685
00:26:01,730 --> 00:26:02,630
Zhao,

686
00:26:02,920 --> 00:26:04,550
this young man is not bad.

687
00:26:04,640 --> 00:26:05,250
Look,

688
00:26:05,440 --> 00:26:06,970
he's quite smart, isn't he?

689
00:26:07,010 --> 00:26:08,660
He's responsible and filial.

690
00:26:08,660 --> 00:26:09,590
How great is that?

691
00:26:09,590 --> 00:26:11,440
This kid is all talk and no action.

692
00:26:11,440 --> 00:26:12,380
Not that great.

693
00:26:12,700 --> 00:26:14,630
What's wrong with your judgement?

694
00:26:14,660 --> 00:26:15,800
This is why

695
00:26:15,850 --> 00:26:17,960
other places can recruit good people,

696
00:26:17,960 --> 00:26:18,980
except our police force.

697
00:26:18,980 --> 00:26:20,380
Not a single smart one.

698
00:26:23,870 --> 00:26:27,020
[Public Security]

699
00:26:40,000 --> 00:26:42,240
[Camera 01]

700
00:26:41,070 --> 00:26:42,270
This piece of plastic

701
00:26:42,290 --> 00:26:45,010
looks very similar to the one found at
Song Laifu's crime scene.

702
00:26:45,010 --> 00:26:47,200
Is there any footage where we can
see his face clearly?

703
00:26:47,200 --> 00:26:48,120
It's blocked.

704
00:26:48,400 --> 00:26:50,260
But notice his shoes and clothes.

705
00:26:50,460 --> 00:26:51,350
Fifteen minutes later,

706
00:26:51,350 --> 00:26:52,950
this person appeared again.

707
00:26:53,830 --> 00:26:56,940
[Camera 01]

708
00:27:09,700 --> 00:27:12,710
[Camera 01]

709
00:27:16,500 --> 00:27:18,750
Xin Jiran appeared at the crime scene

710
00:27:19,570 --> 00:27:21,430
and is a major suspect in the case.

711
00:27:22,680 --> 00:27:24,310
Apply for a summons immediately.

712
00:27:24,310 --> 00:27:26,480
Send more people to find him.

713
00:27:27,640 --> 00:27:28,220
Yes.

714
00:27:34,940 --> 00:27:36,720
Why are the police looking for you?

715
00:27:36,720 --> 00:27:37,940
Something happened.

716
00:27:37,940 --> 00:27:39,830
I can't explain it
in a few words right now.

717
00:27:39,830 --> 00:27:41,140
Let's talk when we meet.

718
00:27:41,140 --> 00:27:43,800
Let's meet at the usual place
at 9 p.m. tomorrow.

719
00:28:11,110 --> 00:28:13,040
Why are you downstairs at my place?

720
00:28:13,250 --> 00:28:14,380
Where are you going?

721
00:28:15,030 --> 00:28:16,250
Benteng Internet Cafe.

722
00:28:16,250 --> 00:28:18,580
The situation is beyond my expectations.

723
00:28:18,720 --> 00:28:21,140
Stop looking for Han Pinmu from today on.

724
00:28:21,440 --> 00:28:23,960
Stop all forms of investigation into him.

725
00:28:24,770 --> 00:28:25,500
Why?

726
00:28:26,350 --> 00:28:28,080
I'm worried about your safety.

727
00:28:28,420 --> 00:28:30,350
The current situation is unclear.

728
00:28:30,480 --> 00:28:31,610
Letting you act freely

729
00:28:31,610 --> 00:28:32,900
is too irresponsible.

730
00:28:33,500 --> 00:28:34,500
Don't worry.

731
00:28:34,610 --> 00:28:36,030
I am willing to take the risk myself.

732
00:28:36,030 --> 00:28:36,850
Still no.

733
00:28:37,790 --> 00:28:38,720
This is an order.

734
00:28:41,740 --> 00:28:44,050
But I already made an appointment with
Han Pinmu.

735
00:28:44,050 --> 00:28:45,400
If I suddenly don't show up,

736
00:28:45,400 --> 00:28:46,730
it will be even weirder.

737
00:28:47,310 --> 00:28:49,200
Then go for the last time today.

738
00:28:49,310 --> 00:28:50,440
Find an excuse.

739
00:28:50,570 --> 00:28:52,500
Just say you'll be away for a while.

740
00:28:52,830 --> 00:28:54,160
Don't go there anymore.

741
00:28:55,240 --> 00:28:55,880
Okay.

742
00:28:58,660 --> 00:29:00,790
Has Xin Jiran contacted you recently?

743
00:29:02,110 --> 00:29:02,920
No.

744
00:29:09,510 --> 00:29:11,640
I'll drop you off at the internet cafe.

745
00:29:27,510 --> 00:29:28,740
Do as I say.

746
00:29:29,440 --> 00:29:31,610
As for work, it depends on what you think.

747
00:29:31,610 --> 00:29:34,380
If you really want to join
the Criminal Investigation Brigade,

748
00:29:34,380 --> 00:29:36,000
I'll risk my old face

749
00:29:36,610 --> 00:29:37,640
to get you in.

750
00:29:38,920 --> 00:29:39,720
Okay.

751
00:29:40,000 --> 00:29:40,880
Thank you, Sir.

752
00:29:40,880 --> 00:29:42,380
Don't call me sir anymore.

753
00:29:42,740 --> 00:29:43,660
Call me Zhao.

754
00:29:46,440 --> 00:29:48,270
Or maybe Master.

755
00:29:48,810 --> 00:29:50,010
But not necessarily.

756
00:29:52,900 --> 00:29:54,560
We'll see when the time comes.

757
00:29:57,000 --> 00:29:58,070
Thank you, Master.

758
00:30:02,380 --> 00:30:03,030
Go.

759
00:30:32,960 --> 00:30:33,750
Didn't you say you weren't coming?

760
00:30:33,750 --> 00:30:34,500
Why are you here again?

761
00:30:34,500 --> 00:30:36,480
I already asked someone else
to play with me.

762
00:30:36,480 --> 00:30:37,510
Count me out.

763
00:30:37,550 --> 00:30:39,030
I'll just watch a video and leave.

764
00:30:39,030 --> 00:30:40,220
I have to pick up my mom.

765
00:30:40,220 --> 00:30:41,880
If I go early, I'll just be waiting.

766
00:30:41,880 --> 00:30:42,790
Even with such a little time,

767
00:30:42,790 --> 00:30:44,520
you still want to delve into it.

768
00:30:46,180 --> 00:30:48,710
With your perseverance,
you can do anything.

769
00:30:52,640 --> 00:30:54,480
Alright, it's about time.

770
00:30:54,700 --> 00:30:55,640
I'm leaving now.

771
00:30:55,720 --> 00:30:56,720
Leaving already?

772
00:31:03,480 --> 00:31:04,160
Wei.

773
00:31:08,290 --> 00:31:10,070
How long has Li Cheng been here?

774
00:31:11,960 --> 00:31:13,500
About ten minutes?

775
00:31:13,500 --> 00:31:15,090
He wants to play even with so little time.

776
00:31:15,090 --> 00:31:16,460
He's really addicted.

777
00:31:21,140 --> 00:31:22,110
Where is Captain Fan?

778
00:31:22,110 --> 00:31:22,770
Over there.

779
00:31:24,740 --> 00:31:25,530
Captain Fan.

780
00:31:26,050 --> 00:31:27,580
Luo made a major discovery.

781
00:31:27,980 --> 00:31:29,240
The DNA from the blood on the wooden stick

782
00:31:29,240 --> 00:31:30,460
at Song Laifu's crime scene

783
00:31:30,460 --> 00:31:32,570
matches the skin tissue under the nails

784
00:31:32,570 --> 00:31:34,400
of the third victim, Liu Xiaohua,

785
00:31:34,400 --> 00:31:35,880
in the 312 Case

786
00:31:35,880 --> 00:31:36,740
8 years ago.

787
00:31:36,790 --> 00:31:39,240
The person with whom Song Laifu had
a confrontation before his death

788
00:31:39,240 --> 00:31:40,900
is one of the suspects at large

789
00:31:40,980 --> 00:31:42,320
from the 312 Case.

790
00:32:09,510 --> 00:32:11,070
The police are all looking for you.

791
00:32:11,070 --> 00:32:13,670
Does Song's death have anything
to do with you?

792
00:32:16,850 --> 00:32:17,790
I was framed.

793
00:32:18,530 --> 00:32:19,750
That afternoon.

794
00:32:21,240 --> 00:32:22,940
I received a call.

795
00:32:23,050 --> 00:32:24,110
The person said

796
00:32:24,530 --> 00:32:26,790
they could provide clues about 312.

797
00:32:28,180 --> 00:32:30,110
The meeting place was very remote.

798
00:32:30,350 --> 00:32:32,220
I knew it could be a trap.

799
00:32:32,850 --> 00:32:33,850
But first,

800
00:32:34,330 --> 00:32:35,700
the meeting was during the day.

801
00:32:35,700 --> 00:32:36,530
Second,

802
00:32:37,330 --> 00:32:39,590
I was afraid of missing the opportunity.

803
00:32:39,830 --> 00:32:40,660
So I went.

804
00:32:41,330 --> 00:32:42,500
I didn't expect that

805
00:32:43,160 --> 00:32:45,420
as soon as I arrived at the meeting place,

806
00:32:46,140 --> 00:32:48,140
Song Laifu had already been killed.

807
00:32:48,440 --> 00:32:50,110
I knew I couldn't explain it clearly,

808
00:32:50,110 --> 00:32:51,910
so I left the scene immediately.

809
00:32:52,090 --> 00:32:53,440
Who called you?

810
00:32:53,660 --> 00:32:54,480
I don't know.

811
00:32:54,850 --> 00:32:55,980
It didn't sound like

812
00:32:56,070 --> 00:32:57,140
Han Pinmu.

813
00:32:57,590 --> 00:32:59,590
They used an unregistered SIM card.

814
00:33:00,420 --> 00:33:01,820
There are no clues at all.

815
00:33:01,920 --> 00:33:03,090
Then why didn't you

816
00:33:03,200 --> 00:33:04,940
report this to the police?

817
00:33:05,010 --> 00:33:06,810
From the police's perspective,

818
00:33:06,920 --> 00:33:08,090
I have a motive,

819
00:33:08,920 --> 00:33:10,790
and I was at the scene.

820
00:33:10,940 --> 00:33:12,110
They wouldn't let me go.

821
00:33:12,110 --> 00:33:13,310
If you don't show up now,

822
00:33:13,310 --> 00:33:14,660
it looks like you're fleeing from justice.

823
00:33:14,660 --> 00:33:15,980
It'll be even harder to explain.

824
00:33:15,980 --> 00:33:17,140
It doesn't matter.

825
00:33:17,640 --> 00:33:18,660
I'm not afraid.

826
00:33:19,130 --> 00:33:22,240
The truth will be found sooner or later.

827
00:33:26,510 --> 00:33:28,170
Then why did you ask to meet me?

828
00:33:28,180 --> 00:33:29,510
What do you want me to do?

829
00:33:32,640 --> 00:33:34,460
Keep in touch with me privately,

830
00:33:36,000 --> 00:33:38,660
and help me gather information
from the police.

831
00:33:39,160 --> 00:33:40,740
Why not ask Zhao Ganzhe?

832
00:33:43,030 --> 00:33:44,550
I told you on the phone.

833
00:33:46,050 --> 00:33:48,110
I don't want to put him in
a difficult position.

834
00:33:48,110 --> 00:33:49,170
He's a good person.

835
00:33:50,740 --> 00:33:52,180
And you're not a good person.?

836
00:33:52,180 --> 00:33:53,910
Have you ever seen a good person

837
00:33:56,140 --> 00:33:57,400
who has been to prison?

838
00:34:02,380 --> 00:34:05,010
